WEBVTT

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:04.295
Open the agent and select Tools

00:00:04.295 --> 00:00:06.596
Pre-call: click API in the side panel

00:00:06.596 --> 00:00:18.575
Name the request and enter the URL

00:00:18.575 --> 00:00:32.142
Add parameters: pass the phone number

00:00:32.142 --> 00:00:35.442
Click Test API to see the response

00:00:35.442 --> 00:00:38.545
Keep only the fields the agent needs

00:00:38.545 --> 00:00:41.570
Click Add to assistant

00:00:41.570 --> 00:00:45.507
On-call: the agent calls these mid-conversation

00:00:45.507 --> 00:00:51.163
Add a transfer destination

00:00:51.163 --> 00:00:54.689
Save the tool

00:00:54.689 --> 00:00:55.810
The tool appears in the phase's list

00:00:55.810 --> 00:00:59.812
Post-call: send the outcome to your systems

00:00:59.812 --> 00:01:05.301
The body can use the summary and analysis values
